          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全定位会话已就绪。您现在可以重新开启移动数据，虚拟定位将继续在蜂窝网络下生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The self-hosted service runs daily maintenance that deletes live events older than 90 days. No fixed deletion schedule is promised for database backups or web-server access logs. TelemetryDeck says it does not store IP addresses and may retain anonymous events for roughly 7–10 years without guaranteeing an exact deletion date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The self-hosted service runs daily maintenance that deletes live events older than 90 days. No fixed deletion schedule is promised for database backups or web-server access logs. TelemetryDeck says it does not store IP addresses and may retain anonymous events for roughly 7–10 years without guaranteeing an exact deletion date."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自建服务每日会执行维护清理，自动删除 90 天前的实时事件。数据库备份或 Web 服务器访问日志不承诺固定的删除周期。TelemetryDeck 声明其不存储 IP 地址，匿名事件可能会保留约 7–10 年，且不保证确切的删除时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored pairing record could not be read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The stored pairing record could not be read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取已存储的配对记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This checks the saved pairing record and whether the paired iPhone is visible through LocalDevVPN. It never starts, changes, or stops your location.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This checks the saved pairing record and whether the paired iPhone is visible through LocalDevVPN. It never starts, changes, or stops your location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作仅检查已保存的配对记录以及是否可通过 LocalDevVPN 发现已配对的 iPhone。它绝不会启动、修改或停止您的定位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the pairing record and local app settings, then shows onboarding again. It does not remove or change LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置将清除配对记录与本地应用偏好，并重置至欢迎页面。这不会删除或修改 LocalDevVPN 应用程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is not paired. Open Pairing & Connection and pair it first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone is not paired. Open Pairing & Connection and pair it first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone 尚未配对。请前往“配对与连接”完成配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is using %@. Stop & Restore ends the simulation and restores its real location.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone is using %@. Stop & Restore ends the simulation and restores its real location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前 iPhone 正在使用 %@。选择“停止并恢复”将结束模拟并还原真实定位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone was not reachable through LocalDevVPN. Check that the tunnel is connected. On mobile data, switch data off briefly and run the check again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone was not reachable through LocalDevVPN. Check that the tunnel is connected. On mobile data, switch data off briefly and run the check again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法通过 LocalDevVPN 访问此 iPhone。请检查隧道是否已连接。若使用移动数据，请短暂关闭蜂窝网络后重新检测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone's pairing service is reachable through LocalDevVPN. Secure session verification happens when you start a location session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone's pairing service is reachable through LocalDevVPN. Secure session verification happens when you start a location session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已可通过 LocalDevVPN 访问此 iPhone 的配对服务。安全会话校验将在您启动定位会话时进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This walking route does not contain enough detail to simulate movement.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
