            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭移动数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning sharing off stops new reporting, cancels requests still in progress where possible and removes the identifier from Roam Control. It cannot withdraw anonymous events already received.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning sharing off stops new reporting, cancels requests still in progress where possible and removes the identifier from Roam Control. It cannot withdraw anonymous events already received."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭共享将立即停止新的数据上报，并在可能的情况下取消正在进行的请求，同时从 Roam Control 中移除该标识符。这无法撤回已接收的匿名事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
